Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:25:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] perf(block): cache state-only sign and wall light shapes

HungSignBlock's collision shape, HungSignBarBlock's outline and collision
shapes, StandingSignBlock's outline shape and AutoConnectWallLightBlock's
outline shape were rebuilt with unions (and streams) on every query,
although each depends only on the block state. Add StateShapeCache, which
runs the unchanged computation once per state and returns that result
afterwards, and route those methods through it. The cache is a
ConcurrentHashMap because shapes are also queried from chunk builder
threads.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
